      "created_at": "2024-07-23T09:40:06.178Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I want to reduce the size of the size and material field box to size of item name and code field.<br>\nI tried dragging the bottom right arrow in the box but after refresh it came to its original size.</p>\n<p>This is how it looks -</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/6/261e9ebd7f5d3b85a0a8c3ae3f4d363c207c4364.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/261e9ebd7f5d3b85a0a8c3ae3f4d363c207c4364\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/6/261e9ebd7f5d3b85a0a8c3ae3f4d363c207c4364_2_499x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"5rdKjPmxLUBUmgN0mzYP7H4BODO\" width=\"499\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/6/261e9ebd7f5d3b85a0a8c3ae3f4d363c207c4364_2_499x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/6/261e9ebd7f5d3b85a0a8c3ae3f4d363c207c4364.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/6/261e9ebd7f5d3b85a0a8c3ae3f4d363c207c4364.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">635×636 11.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>This is how it should look -</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/a/8ab1b41001aaca410b7b417f7f3128910f810a59.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"jMWCm1XIVQrJ1Qr49E6fGOb4QGd\" width=\"638\" height=\"422\"></p>",
