      "id": 423994,
      "username": "Manav_Mandli",
      "name": "Manav Mandli",
      "created_at": "2024-07-23T15:43:57.602Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hii <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/anjalijangid\">@Anjalijangid</a></p>\n<p>Change the field types of both fields from small text to data.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/b/ab6ce7c4ccefd3df41943adca7ac67645ffd1e5f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ab6ce7c4ccefd3df41943adca7ac67645ffd1e5f\" title=\"Screenshot 2024-07-23 211303\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/b/ab6ce7c4ccefd3df41943adca7ac67645ffd1e5f_2_690x318.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-07-23 211303\" data-base62-sha1=\"osuYw2erzNd6BF968j3Htan7Hkz\" width=\"690\" height=\"318\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/b/ab6ce7c4ccefd3df41943adca7ac67645ffd1e5f_2_690x318.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/b/ab6ce7c4ccefd3df41943adca7ac67645ffd1e5f_2_1035x477.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/b/ab6ce7c4ccefd3df41943adca7ac67645ffd1e5f_2_1380x636.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F6F5F3\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2024-07-23 211303</span><span class=\"informations\">1722×796 77 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/manav_mandli/{size}/71011_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
