      "created_at": "2024-07-24T06:49:29.042Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/minhyeong-lee\">@MinHyeong-Lee</a> and <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/anjalijangid\">@Anjalijangid</a>,</p>\n<p>You can easily set it without script via customize form that <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/eugenep\">@EugeneP</a> provided in the post, so follow the step.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"EugeneP\" data-post=\"3\" data-topic=\"129334\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/eugenep/48/55852_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> EugeneP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>On the DocType definition, provide a value for the “Max Height” setting in px, em, rem<br>\nNote however that this is the maximum height the input control will expand to, not only the initial height.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
